# Copy this file outside the repository, then set WHATSAPP_WAKE_CONFIG
# to that copy. Paste the routine URL and the credential there yourself.
# A pasted credential may be the header value alone, or the whole header line.
# The field name is removed before the request. The value is not printed.
# This example is not a credential. Values stay empty and transmission stays off.

WHATSAPP_WAKE_ENABLED=0
WHATSAPP_WAKE_URL=
WHATSAPP_WAKE_AUTHORIZATION=
WHATSAPP_WAKE_ALLOWLIST_LABEL=
WHATSAPP_WAKE_ROUTINE_AUTHORIZATION=
# Leave unset until the receiver is ready and the host wrapper is regenerated.
# v1 posts one configured label. v2 posts a fixture chatRef. list posts a
# targetless list-change and holds the named list signal. Any other value stays on v1.
# WHATSAPP_WAKE_WIRE=v1
# Leave unset. official treats any 2xx as transport accepted and does not
# read a receipt body. test-receipt is only for the local routine server.
# WHATSAPP_WAKE_TRANSPORT=official
